    {
      "id": "1c00d75f-7b5e-4952-88de-fb6018f617fc",
      "text": "System adheres to a 'keep it very simple' principle: no row-level security at seven query sites, no Redis, no Celery, and no hosted authentication; each omission is argued against concretely in hz-accounts/report.md §5.3 and §7.2. | Involving: captain (or team) | to maintain architectural simplicity",
      "type": "world",
      "entities": [
        "Redis",
        "Celery",
        "RLS",
        "hosted auth"
      ],
